OL,3,GNEWSAPC killed by car going wrong-way
OL,4,Awas 'hero'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the two police officers who were
OL,7,Fkilled when a car travelling the wrong
OL,8,Fway down a dual carriageway crashed
OL,9,Finto them was a "hero", his family has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FPC Tom Clough, 38, died alongside his
OL,13,Fcolleague PC Matthew Blades, 37, when a
OL,14,FVolkswagen Passat, which officers had
OL,15,Fbeen pursuing until seconds before,
OL,16,Fcollided with their vehicle on the A66
OL,17,Fnear Middlesbrough on Saturday.
OL,19,FThe Passat's occupants Michael Robert
OL,20,FCahill, 23, Jacob Matusiak, 23, Theo
OL,21,FRae, 17, Makai Saddington, 18, and Cole
OL,22,FRobert Worthy, 17, also died.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
