OL,3,GNEWSAPC killed by car going wrong-way
OL,4,Awas 'hero'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPC Clough's family said: "We as a
OL,7,Ffamily and Tom's partner would like to
OL,8,Fexpress our sincere gratitude for the
OL,9,Foverwhelming support and condolences."
